# King T'Challa: "Whenever a player draws their second card each turn, you draw a card." On turn 2 Bot2 draws for the
# turn (its first card: nothing) and casts Opt, its second card: Bot1 draws one (Bot1's own first card that turn, which
# does not trigger it again). On turn 3 Bot1 draws for the turn (first) and casts Opt: its own second card triggers too
# ("a player" is any player, CR 603.2), and the card that trigger draws is Bot1's third, which does not (CR 120.3). So
# Bot1 draws four cards in all: one on turn 2, three on turn 3; a trigger on the first or third draw would draw more.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
King T'Challa
Opt
Island
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Opt
Island
Island x25

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.King T'Challa.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Opt.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Opt.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Library.Count = 16
Bot2.Library.Count = 18
Bot1.Battlefield.King T'Challa.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.King T'Challa.Toughness = 2
